Game Balancing & Progression
This document details the costs, rewards, XP gains, and unlock requirements for all game elements.

1. Player Level & Progression
Leveling Up: Requires converting Essence to XP.
Benefits: Unlocks higher caps for Upgrades and Buildings.
2. Buildings (Edificios)
Buildings generate passive Essence per second.

Unlock Formula: Max Count = (Player Level / 2) + 1 L1-2: 1 Building, L3-4: 2 Buildings, etc.

Building	Base Cost	Cost Scale	Production/sec	XP Reward	Description
Recolector	100	x1.7	1.0	50 XP	Genera esencia básica
Mina	750	x1.8	5.0	50 XP	Extrae esencia de la tierra
Cantera	4,000	x1.9	20.0	50 XP	Producción industrial
Yacimiento	15,000	x2.0	75.0	50 XP	Fuente masiva de esencia
Fábrica	75,000	x2.1	250.0	50 XP	Tecnología punta
> Note: Cost Formula = Base * Scale^Count

3. Upgrades (Mejoras)
Upgrades enhance active or passive play.

Unlock Formula: Tiered System L1-3: Max Level 1 | L4-6: Max Level 2 | ... | L51+: Max Level 12 (or absolute max)

Global Upgrades
XP Reward: 40 XP (Unlock), 40 XP (Level Up)

Upgrade	Base Cost	Cost Scaling	Max Level	Effect per Level	Note
Fuerza de Tap	25	x1.5	30	+1 Essence/tap	Manual Tap
Ritmo Interior	100	x1.6	15	+5% Tap Power	Multiplier
Flujo Esencial	2,000	x2.5	15	+5% Global Prod	Multiplier
Eco Persistente	2,000	Fixed List*	5	+15% Offline Eff	Starts at 5% base
Almacén Energía	500	500 * 1.6^L	12	+200 Steps Cap	Dynamic Cost
